{"title":"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are four consecutive positive integers (natural numbers) less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b442c275b4324f100c365b774e872b6b21f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> such that the first (smallest) number is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the second number is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the third number is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the last number is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the first of these four numbers?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the first number. Then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/9/bc9e67c441743c7027cd42331fea4467e2b0d7cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{eqnarray*} n &amp;\\equiv&amp; 0 \\pmod{5}\\\\ n \\equiv -1 &amp;\\equiv&amp; 6 \\pmod{7}\\\\ n \\equiv -2 &amp;\\equiv&amp; 7 \\pmod{9}\\\\ n \\equiv -3 &amp;\\equiv&amp; 8 \\pmod{11}\\\\\\end{eqnarray*}\" width=\"204\" height=\"93\" />\n</p><p>Applying the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chinese_Remainder_Theorem\" title=\"Chinese Remainder Theorem\">Chinese Remainder Theorem</a>, we can eventually find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/06383ce52170567cccc0eadab1de0ed45fc49371.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 1735 \\pmod{3465}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"18\" />. (We can do this by solving the first two to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e3977911ef592f5a5f468e9c853cc230ce7a3dd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 20 \\pmod {35}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" /> and the second two to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/01404ea61e6e0dafffbc530d50b78d157e9430b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 52 \\pmod{99}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />, and then list out all of the numbers that fit the second condition until we hit one that fits the first condition. This is not as tedious as it may seem, since we know that the result must be divisible by 5.) Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c125cfebc9d082da002dcaa53b6365fc31b15fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; n &lt; 2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/f/32fa63caf0a0115b48519ed308e197160264713d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1735$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC\" title=\"2005 PMWC\">2005 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">Problem I8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">Problem I10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I13\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I14\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I15\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I15\">15</a> <br /> T: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T2\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T3\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T5\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T6\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T9\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T10\">10</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017111344\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 117/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1656/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 126/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2286/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.044      1 Template:PMWC_box\n100.00%    8.044      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5505:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017111344 and revision id 68663. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}